.Hecke.MarkovBondLetterColimit.tr_bond_letter_colimit_of_z_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetterColimit.tr_bond_letter_colimit_of_z_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetterColimit.lean#L68-L75","doc":"**`z = 0`: the letter contributes `d`**, the scalar of `TauBondLetter.tau_bond_letter`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetterColimit.tr_bond_letter_colimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetterColimit.tr_bond_letter_colimit","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetterColimit.lean#L60-L66","doc":"**The bond-letter law on the Hecke colimit.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}